## Cassandra

**Modulo**: [cassandra-driver](https://github.com/datastax/nodejs-driver)

### Installazione

<PackageManagerCommand command="npm install cassandra-driver" />

### Esempio

```cjs title="index.cjs"
const cassandra = require('cassandra-driver');
const client = new cassandra.Client({ contactPoints: ['localhost'] });

client.execute('select key from system.local', (err, result) => {
  if (err) throw err;
  console.log(result.rows[0]);
});
```

```mjs title="index.mjs"
